  "name": "Korean Pokémon World Championships 2016 Korea qualifier",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The 2016 Korean qualifier for the Pokémon World Championships was held at Hyundai Department Store Pangyo, with the card game preliminaries on 5 May 2016 and the final on 7 May 2016. Garchomp-EX 140/XY-P was a gift for adding the official KakaoTalk friend, M Garchomp-EX 141/XY-P and Garchomp Spirit Link 142/XY-P were rewards for earning 100 points, and the top players received Victory Ring cards 143 to 145/XY-P."
  },
